cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "leaf-spectra-disease"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Bakousi
    given-names: Aikaterini
version: 0.1.0
date-released: 2026-11-13
license: Apache-2.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/kbakousi/leaf-spectra-disease"
keywords: [hyperspectral, plant disease, grapevine, spectroscopy, cross-validation, one-class classification]
abstract: >-
  Leaf-level hyperspectral analysis for plant disease detection: reading Specim IQ / ENVI data and pixel
  exports, spectral preprocessing, narrow-band indices, leaf aggregation, classifiers and one-class screening,
  with validation that holds out whole leaves and dates.
references:
